<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/11th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Listven</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1024</span> · <a href="/centuries/11th-century">11th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Listven was fought in 1024 near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chernigov">Chernigov</a> between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mstislav-of-tmutarakan">Mstislav of Tmutarakan</a> and his brother <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yaroslav-the-wise">Yaroslav the Wise</a>, prince of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kyiv">Kiev</a>, who had hired Varangian troops. Mstislav won, and the brothers then divided the Rus' lands along the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dnieper">Dnieper</a>, Mstislav ruling the east from Chernigov until his death in 1036.</p></div>
